The data files in this directory are provided to make simulations with INCL/ABLA++:
table_radius_hfb.dat - HFB density profile parameters to define the nuclei in INCL
 	    defo.dat - ground state deformations
	 flalpha.dat - alpha ground state deformation
	   frldm.dat - ground state shell corr. frldm for a spherical g.s.  
	 mmfrldm.dat - macroscopic-microscopic finite-range liquid-drop model fission barriers
 	   vgsld.dat - difference between deformed g.s. and ldm value
   	   pace2.dat - default mass for A, Z nucleus
  	     rms.dat - Parameters for the calculation of particle emission barriers
	mass2003.dat - Experimental mass evaluation AME2003
	mass2012.dat - Experimental mass evaluation AME2012
	mass2016.dat - Experimental mass evaluation AME2016
	mass2020.dat - Experimental mass evaluation AME2020


The data in this directory is meant to be used for INCL/ABLA++ models
source/processes/hadronic/models/incl

ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS

These data files are provided with INCL++ and ABLA++.

